@startuml
[*] --> Idle
state "Idle" as Idle
Idle --> LoggedIn : login successful
LoggedIn --> MarketConditions : select market condition
MarketConditions --> MarketReport : view report
LoggedIn --> PestControlHelp : select pest control help
PestControlHelp --> PestControlTechniques : provide photo
PestControlHelp --> PestControlTechniques : select technique
LoggedIn --> SoilSuggestions : provide soil info
SoilSuggestions --> SoilSuggestions : receive suggestions
LoggedIn --> WeatherInsights : provide location
WeatherInsights --> WeatherInsights : view insights
LoggedIn --> LabourAvailability : provide location
LabourAvailability --> LabourAvailability : view details
LoggedIn --> Idle : continue using service

state "LoggedOut" as LoggedOut
LoggedIn --> [*] : logout
@enduml
